#. module: om_ai_mcp_client
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_ai_mcp_client
msgid ""
"\n"
"Connect Odoo to MCP servers outside Odoo. Their tools are imported as AI tools: the AI Assistant\n"
"in Discuss and the agents of the AI engine call them, read-only tools directly and the others after\n"
"the user confirms. Authentication with a bearer token or an OAuth sign-in (PKCE, token refresh),\n"
"allowed groups per server and every call in the AI usage log.\n"
msgstr ""

